'''Green Gift''' is a [[Gift]] obtained from {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. A player can give this to another player, allowing both of them to receive rewards.

== Obtaining ==
=== Gift Locations ===
Every SkyBlock Year, the player can speak to {{NPCSprite|St. Jerry}} to obtain a '''Green Gift''' after claiming all 20 {{Item|White Gift}}s across {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

=== Frozen Treasure ===
Within the {{Zone|Glacial Cave}}, players can mine [[Frozen Treasure]] to obtain '''Green Gifts'''.

=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}
Damaging a {{MobSprite|Reindrake}} also has a {{Green|25%}} chance to drop a '''Green Gift'''.

=== Season of Jerry ===
During the [[Season of Jerry]] event, players can earn '''Gifts''' in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}} of all kinds across waves for [[Defend Jerry's Workshop|defending]] the village.

== Usage ==
=== Gifts ===
A '''Green Gift''' can be given to another player to spawn a present in which that player can open, with both players receiving the item inside. Once opened, the item will drop on the ground and only the 2 players that opened and gifted the present will be able to pick up the items.

{{Item|Snowman Mask}}, {{Item|White Gift Talisman}} [[Accessory]] line, {{Item|Snowfin Shard}} and the Professional Gifter perk from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} give more rewards from [[Gifts]]. '''Green Gifts''' also have a {{Green|30%}} chance to give the player {{North Stars|1-3}}.
